@@ -0,0 +1,1334 @@
+From 42cc9ebf770a36e1f6358b9f5e8cb19ae53f06be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: TrinityXSX <trinityxsx@users.noreply.github.com>
+Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 16:04:02 +0100
+Subject: [PATCH] win32u: Render PS5 in-game toast notifications over Vulkan
+ swapchains.
+
+Hook win32u_vkCreateSwapchainKHR, win32u_vkDestroySwapchainKHR, win32u_vkDestroyDevice, and win32u_vkQueuePresentKHR to composite a lightweight semi-transparent top-right notification pill read from ntdll's pw_wine_toast() onto any presenting Vulkan swapchain (DXVK, vkd3d-proton, Zink, XCL). When no toast is visible, the fast path returns immediately with zero GPU work; if setup fails or a swapchain is unsupported, presentation falls through untouched.
+---
+ dlls/win32u/Makefile.in    |    1 +
+ dlls/win32u/ps5_toast_vk.c | 1186 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
+ dlls/win32u/vulkan.c       |   63 ++
+ 3 files changed, 1250 insertions(+)
+ create mode 100644 dlls/win32u/ps5_toast_vk.c
+
